"\n## Antigravity CLI: Gemini CLI is now Antigravity CLI\n\nAs of June 18, 2026, the Gemini CLI service has been discontinued.  \nThis applies to all tiers — free, Pro, and Ultra — and users have been migrated to use Antigravity CLI as the successor.\n\n### Install\n\n\n### Usage\nAfter installation, you can launch the CLI with the agy command.\n\n"